      "name": "满分版",
      "theme": "self-discipline（自律）",
      "words": 205,
      "essay": "Though deceptively simple, this scene conveys a meaningful message: at a desk piled with papers, a girl who is working attentively says, \"I feel at ease only when I finish early,\" while a boy sits back at another desk, saying, \"I won't start until the last minute.\" It serves as a compelling testament to the significance of self-discipline. Self-discipline has attracted attention, not least because of its far-reaching implications. At the individual level, it is reflected in the way people turn plans into action and replace excuses with effort, ultimately contributing to tangible achievements and reduced stress. For example, starting an assignment early leaves time to check for mistakes. National policies on quality education likewise focus on empowering individuals to bridge the gap between knowing and doing. Beyond personal advancement, this principle can strengthen communities by building a culture of excellence and accountability, laying the groundwork for sustainable progress. This is in line with national strategies for a spirit of hard work and dedication: as this principle takes root, professional standards rise across industries. In conclusion, a rational consensus has emerged that both individuals and communities benefit immeasurably when self-discipline guides action. Promoting this principle is therefore not merely advisable but essential for holistic development.",
      "zh": "尽管画面看似简单，却传递出深刻的信息：在一张堆着材料的书桌前，一名认真书写的女孩说：“尽早完成才放心”；另一名男孩则靠坐在另一张桌旁，说着：“不到最后不动手。”它有力地证明了自律的重要性。自律受到关注，一个重要原因是其影响深远。在个人层面，它体现在人们的具体做法中：将计划化为行动，以努力代替借口，最终有助于取得切实成果并减轻压力。例如，提早开始一项作业，可以留出检查错误的时间。国家在素质教育方面的政策，同样着重于使个人能够缩小认知与行动之间的差距。除个人发展之外，这一原则还可以通过形成追求卓越、重视责任的风气来增强社区，为可持续进步奠定基础。这与国家关于劳动、奋斗与奉献精神的战略相契合：随着这一理念逐渐扎根，各行业的职业标准普遍提高。总之，人们已经形成一种基于理性认识的共识，即当自律成为行动的指引时，个人与社区都能获得不可估量的益处。因此，倡导这一原则不仅可取，而且是全面发展的必要条件。"
